      "items": [
        "In-place upgrade: upgrade the existing cluster directly — resource efficient but rollback is complex (dev/test)",
        "Blue/green deployment: build a new-version cluster and switch — safe rollback, duplicated resources (production)",
        "Canary deployment: move only some workloads to the new cluster — gradual verification, dual operation (critical production)"
